<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech C.Bank end-June forex reserves $10.76 bln.</title>
<headline>Czech C.Bank end-June forex reserves $10.76 bln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank's (CNB) foreign currency reserves stood at $10.764 billion at the end of June, up from $10.025 billion at the end of May, the CNB said on Monday.</p>
<p>The CNB added that foreign reserves of the entire banking sector stood at $15.041 billion at the end of June, compared with a revised $14.485 billion at the end of May.  </p>
<p> CZECH FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES  JUN 97    MAY 97   JUN 96</p>
<p>  Czech National Bank ($ bln)     10.764    10.025   12.700</p>
<p>  commercial banks		     4.277     4.460    4.300</p>
<p>  total forex reserves		15.041    14.485   17.000</p>
<p>-- (nigel.stephenson@reuters.com)</p>
<p>	 Prague Newsroom, +420-2-2423-0003</p>
